      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndî dia Yehowa diakambeye bualu bua Babulona ne bua buloba bua Bena Kasada, mukana mua Yelemiya muprofete:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua tshisamba tshidi tshifume ku luseke lua node tshidi tshilua bua kumuluisha, tshilualua kuvuisha buloba buandi tshikisu, kakuena muntu washikamamu; ne bantu ne nyama nebinyeme, nebiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mu matuku au ne mu tshikondo atshi bana ba Isalele nebalue, bobo ne Bena Yuda hohamue; nebaye mu nshila wabo, benda badila, nebakebe Yehowa Nzambi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebebeshe bantu bua nshila wa ku Siona, batangishe mpala yabo ku musoko wawa, bamba ne, Luai, lulamate kudi Yehowa mu tshihungidi tshia tshiendelele tshidi katshiyi mua kuhuibua muoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu banyi bakadi bu mikoko mijimine, balami babo bakubahambuisha mu nshila, bakubalekelela bua kuendakanabo hatuhu ha mikuna; bakuendakana ku mukuna munene tô ne ku mukuna mukese; bakuhua muaba wa tshikishilu tshiabo muoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonso bakadi babasangana bakubadia, bena lukuna babo bakamba ne, Tuetu katuena bahile, bualu bua bobo bakuenzela Yehowa bibi. Yeye nduhangu lua buakane, bakuenzela Yehowa mene, ditekemena dia batatu babo, bibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatukai mu Babulona bua kunyema, luhukai mu buloba bua Bena Kasada; nuikale bu mpumbu ya mbushi ku mpala kua bisumbu biai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua monai, nembishe tshisumbu tshia bantu ba mu bisamba binene bia ku luseke lua node, nembatume bua kuluanganabo ne Bena Babulona, nebele mualu wa nvita ku mpala kuabo, babaluisha tô ne habumushabo mu muaba wabo. Mikete yabo neyikale bu mukete wa umena ndudi udi kayi uhingana bianza bituhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Buloba bua Bena Kasada nebuikale bu tshintu tshinyengibue mu nvita. Bonso badi babahaula nebukute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isalele udi bu tshisumbu tshia mikoko idi mitangadisha, nyama ya ntambue yakumuihata. Diambedi mukelenge wa Ashû wakamumina, hashishe, mu tshikondo etshi Nebukadenesâ, mukelenge wa Babulona, wakutshibula mifuba yandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa wa misumba, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Monai, nenkengeshe mukelenge wa Babulona ne buloba buandi, bu munakukengesha mukelenge wa Ashû. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nempingashe Isalele mu luhangu luandi lua mikoko, neadie mashinde a ku Kâmele ne Bashana, muoyo wandi neukute ha mikuna ya mu Efelayima ne ya mu Gilada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Mu matuku au ne mu tshikondo atshi nebakebe dihambuka dia Bena Isalele dia ku buakane, kadi kabena badimona, nebakebe malu mabi a Bena Yuda, kadi kabena basangana; bualu bua meme nembuikidile mibi ya bantu bandi nshiya bu difuka didi dishala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edi ndî dia badi banyema ne badi bahanduka mu buloba bua Babulona, dia kuambila ba mu Siona bualu bua kudisombuela kua Yehowa Nzambi wetu, disombuela didiye udisombuela nʼadi ntempelo wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikilai bananyi ba mata bua kuluisha Bena Babulona, bonso badi banana buta; babanyunguluke ne bitudilu bia bena nvita mu nseke yonso, muntu wandi umue kahanduki: Numufute bu mudi bienzedi biandi, bualu bua wakudibandisha ku mpala kua Yehowa, Wa Tshijila wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nunku bansongalume bandi nebahone mu misesu yandi, bena nvita bandi bonso nebatekeshibue mu dituku adi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wa misumba udi wamba ne, Bana ba Isalele ne bana ba Yuda badi bakengeshibua hohamue, bonso bakaya nʼabo mu buhika badi babakuata bikole, badi babenga kubakela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhikudi wabo udi mukole; Yehowa wa misumba ndina diandi; yeye neabakuile tshilumbu tshiabo biakane, bua amanye mua kuvuishila buloba dikisha ne bua kutatshisheye ba mu Babulona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nyama ya mu tshihela ne mibuabua idi idila miadi neyikalemu, ne nyunyu ya nfiondo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50.39",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyunyu ei idi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "autruches",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " neyikalemu; bantu kabena bashikamamu kabidi tô ne tshiendelele, bantu kabena bikalamu ku tshinga tshikondo tô ne ku tshikondo tshikuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bu muakashiha Nzambi Sodoma ne Amola ne misoko yakadi ha buihi, nunku kakuena muntu washikamamu, kakuena muana wa muntu watulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
